@startuml F6.2-D01-relatorios-coordenacao
title F6.2-D01 — Relatórios de coordenação (cache MISS)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Coordenador" as Coord
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ReportController" as Ctrl
participant "CoordinatorReportUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Coord -> WebApp: /coordenacao/relatorios
note right of WebApp
  Skeleton (isLoading)
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /reports/coordinator
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: aggregations
Postgres --> UC: datasets
UC --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Coord: KPIs + gráficos

@enduml
